    "prerequisites": "Perception 5 ranks",
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p><em>Your senses are attuned to the subtlest movements of the world, an ever-vigilant guardian in the realm of shadows.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Perception 5 ranks</p>\n<p>You have trained your senses to an extraordinary level. You gain advantage when attempting to locate hidden or invisible creatures. Furthermore, when a creature with the hidden or invisible condition makes a flat check to avoid an attack, the DC is increased by 1.</p>\n<p><em>Applied automatically:</em> a hidden or invisible creature's flat check to avoid your attacks is 1 harder. <em>Offered:</em> advantage on Search and Awareness checks — tick it when you are locating a hidden or invisible creature.</p>",
